{
  "id": "EZK.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekiel 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou also, son of man, take thee a tile, and lay it before thee, and pourtray upon it the city,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And lay siege against it, and build a fort against it, and cast a mount against it; set the camp also against it, and set",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "battering",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rams against it round about.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover take thou unto thee an iron pan, and set it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wall of iron between thee and the city: and set thy face against it, and it shall be besieged, and thou shalt lay siege against it. This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sign to the house of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lie thou also upon thy left side, and lay the iniquity of the house of Israel upon it:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "according",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the number of the days that thou shalt lie upon it thou shalt bear their iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I have laid upon thee the years of their iniquity, according to the number of the days, three hundred and ninety days: so shalt thou bear the iniquity of the house of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when thou hast accomplished them, lie again on thy right side, and thou shalt bear the iniquity of the house of Judah forty days: I have appointed thee each day for a year.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thou shalt set thy face toward the siege of Jerusalem, and thine arm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uncovered, and thou shalt prophesy against it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, behold, I will lay bands upon thee, and thou shalt not turn thee from one side to another, till thou hast ended the days of thy siege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Take thou also unto thee wheat, and barley, and beans, and lentiles, and millet, and fitches, and put them in one vessel, and make thee bread thereof,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "according",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the number of the days that thou shalt lie upon thy side, three hundred and ninety days shalt thou eat thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thy meat which thou shalt eat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by weight, twenty shekels a day: from time to time shalt thou eat it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt drink also water by measure, the sixth part of an hin: from time to time shalt thou drink.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt eat it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barley cakes, and thou shalt bake it with dung that cometh out of man, in their sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said, Even thus shall the children of Israel eat their defiled bread among the Gentiles, whither I will drive them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said I, Ah Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.4.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! behold, my soul hath not been polluted: for from my youth up even till now have I not eaten of that which dieth of itself, or is torn in pieces; neither came there abominable flesh into my mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said unto me, Lo, I have given thee cow's dung for man's dung, and thou shalt prepare thy bread therewith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover he said unto me, Son of man, behold, I will break the staff of bread in Jerusalem: and they shall eat bread by weight, and with care; and they shall drink water by measure, and with astonishment:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That they may want bread and water, and be astonied one with another, and consume away for their iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "EZK.5",
    "number": "5",
    "bookId": "EZK"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "EZK.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "EZK"
  }
}